     1,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">     The “BY” syntax in the Mplus codes implies a higher order factor, but I think that is a mistake.  You do have to fix its variance and force it to be orthogonal to F1, but I think your task is simpler than this, as long as you directly fix the parameters that need fixing.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#fafafa\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F1 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> ind11 + ind12 + ind13</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> ind21 + ind22 + ind23</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F3 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> ind31 + ind32 + ind33</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><br><span>F2 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> F1 + F2_residual</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">~~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">0</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">*</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F2</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2_residual ~~ 1*F2_residual<u></u><u></u></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#fafafa\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F2_residual </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">~~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">0</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">*</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F1</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><br><span>F3 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> F2_residual + F1</span></span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">I would expect this to work.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">--Ed Rigdon<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
    ],
