     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a>] <b>On Behalf Of </b><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kretzsc...@gmail.com</a><br><b>Sent:</b> Friday, October 10, 2014 10:27 AM<br><b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a><br><b>Subject:</b> Residuals of a latent regression to predict further variables / higher order factor identification<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">Hi lavaan fellows,<br><br>I want to use the residuals of a latent regression to predict a third variable, that is:<br><br>- Variable 1 predicts Variable 2 <br>- Residuals of Variable 2 (i.e., withouth the influence of Variable 1) and Variable 1 predict Variable 3<br><br>It is sometimes used in the literature, for example in Wüstenberg et al. (2012), page 9-10, Figure 5 (see attachment). They used a MPlus syntax like this one:<u></u><u></u></p><div style=\"border:solid #bbbbbb 1.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;word-wrap:break-word\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#fafafa\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F1 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#000088\">by</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> ind11 ind12 ind13</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#000088\">by</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> ind21 ind22 ind23</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F3 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#000088\">by</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> ind31 ind32 ind33</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><br><span>F2 on F1</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2_residual </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#000088\">by</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2@0</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2_residual </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#000088\">with</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> F1@0</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><br><span>F3 on F2_residual F1</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><br>I would adapt it to lavaan in this way:<u></u><u></u></p><div style=\"border:solid #bbbbbb 1.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;word-wrap:break-word\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#fafafa\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F1 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> ind11 ind12 ind13</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> ind21 ind22 ind23</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F3 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> ind31 ind32 ind33</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><br><span>F2 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> F1</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2_residual </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> F2</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">~~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">0</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">*</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F2</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2_residual </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">~~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">0</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">*</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F1</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><br><span>F3 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> F2_residual F1</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><br>Would you agree? <br><br>Well, actually my Factor 2 is a higher order factor of two latent factors. According to Brown (2006), page 205, Figure 5.3, and some thoughts about identification I would model Factor 2 in this way:<u></u><u></u></p><div style=\"border:solid #bbbbbb 1.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;word-wrap:break-word\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#fafafa\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">1</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> NA</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">*</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">ind21 ind22 ind23</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> NA</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">*</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">ind24 ind25 ind26</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">1</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">~~ 1*</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><br><span><span style=\"color:black\">F2</span><span style=\"color:#666600\">.</span><span style=\"color:#006666\">2</span><span style=\"color:black\"> </span><span style=\"color:#666600\">~~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> 1*F2</span><span style=\"color:#666600\">.</span><span style=\"color:#006666\">2</span></span><span style=\"color:#006666\"><br></span><span style=\"color:black\"><br><span>F2 </span></span><span><span style=\"color:#666600\">=~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> NA</span><span style=\"color:#666600\">*</span><span style=\"color:black\">F2</span><span style=\"color:#666600\">.</span><span style=\"color:#006666\">1</span><span style=\"color:black\"> </span><span style=\"color:#666600\">+</span><span style=\"color:black\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#666600\">*</span><span style=\"color:black\">F2</span><span style=\"color:#666600\">.</span><span style=\"color:#006666\">1</span><span style=\"color:black\"> </span><span style=\"color:#666600\">+</span><span style=\"color:black\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#666600\">*</span><span style=\"color:black\">F2</span><span style=\"color:#666600\">.</span><span style=\"color:#006666\">2</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><br><span>F2 </span></span><span><span style=\"color:#666600\">~~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> </span><span style=\"color:#006666\">1</span><span style=\"color:#666600\">*</span><span style=\"color:black\">F2</span></span><u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><br>That is, the factor loadings of the latent factors to the higher order factor are constrained to equality for identification issues. Still okay?<br><br>Okay, now there is a problem with the combined syntax:<u></u><u></u></p><div style=\"border:solid #bbbbbb 1.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;word-wrap:break-word\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#fafafa\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"># measurement models</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">1</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> NA</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">*</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">ind21 ind22 ind23</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> NA</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">*</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">ind24 ind25 ind26</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">1</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">~~ 1*</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br><span>F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">~~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> 1*F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">2</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\"><br></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F2 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=~</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> NA</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">*</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">1</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">+</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> a</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">*</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">1</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">+</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> a</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">*</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">F2</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">2</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><br><span><span style=\"color:black\">F2 </span><span style=\"color:#666600\">~~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> </span><span style=\"color:#006666\">1</span><span style=\"color:#666600\">*</span><span style=\"color:black\">F2</span></span><br><br><span><span style=\"color:black\">F1 </span><span style=\"color:#666600\">=~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> ind11 ind12 ind13</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><br><span>F3 </span></span><span><span style=\"color:#666600\">=~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> ind31 ind32 ind33</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><br><br><br><span># structural models</span><br><span>F2 </span></span><span><span style=\"color:#666600\">~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> F1</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><br><span>F2_residual </span></span><span><span style=\"color:#666600\">=~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> F2</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><br><span>F2 </span></span><span><span style=\"color:#666600\">~~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> </span><span style=\"color:#006666\">0</span><span style=\"color:#666600\">*</span><span style=\"color:black\">F2</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><br><span>F2_residual </span></span><span><span style=\"color:#666600\">~~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> </span><span style=\"color:#006666\">0</span><span style=\"color:#666600\">*</span><span style=\"color:black\">F1</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><br><br><span>F3 </span></span><span><span style=\"color:#666600\">~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> F2_residual F1</span></span><u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><br>It produces this error message: <u></u><u></u></p><blockquote style=\"border:none;border-left:solid #cccccc 1.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 6.0pt;margin-left:4.8pt;margin-right:0in\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Error in lavParseModelString(model) : <br>  lavaan ERROR: duplicate model element in: F2~~0*F2<u></u><u></u></p></blockquote><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>I understand the problem (F2 ~~1*F2 vs F2~~0*F2) somehow, but I do not know a solution. Is there another possibilty to model Factor 2 in a way that I can skip F2 ~~1*F2? Or is there another way to use the residuals of Factor 2?<br><br>Best,<br>André<br><br><br>References: <u></u><u></u></p><div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\">Brown, T. A. (2006). <i>Confirmatory factor analysis for applied research</i>. New York: Guilford Press.<u></u><u></u></p></div></div><div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:200%\">Wüstenberg, S., Greiff, S., &amp; Funke, J. (2012). Complex problem solving — More than reasoning? <i>Intelligence</i>, <i>40</i>, 1–14. doi:10.1016/j.intell.2011.11.003<u></u><u></u></p></div></div></div></div></div>"
